  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut sweet potato into bite-sized chunks. <br>• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle <br>with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. <br>Toss to coat, then bake until tender, <br>20-25 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-58d36e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the sweet potato is roasting, finely chop <br>brown onion and garlic.<br>• Pick thyme leaves. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-08d7c310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil<br>over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, <br>until softened, 5 minutes. Add garlic, thyme<br>and garlic &amp; herb seasoning and cook until <br>fragrant, 1 minute. <br>• Add risotto-style rice and stir to coat. Add <br>the water and stock concentrate, then bring to <br>the boil. <br>• Remove from heat, then transfer risotto to a <br>baking dish. Cover tightly with foil and bake in <br>the oven until liquid is absorbed and rice is <br>‘al dente’, 24-28 minutes. <br>TIP: ‘Al dente’ rice is cooked through but still slightly <br>firm in the centre. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-c356dd20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the risotto has 15 minutes cook time <br>remaining, roughly chop silverbeet. <br>• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of <br>olive oil and the butter. <br>• Add sliced mushrooms and cook, stirring until <br>well browned, 5-6 minutes. <br>• Add silverbeet and cook until wilted, <br>1-2 minutes. Season with salt and pepper<br>to taste.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-b3ffb130.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Remove risotto from the oven. Add a splash of <br>water to loosen the risotto.<br>• Gently stir in roasted sweet potato and cooked <br>veggies. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-056dbe40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide the roasted sweet potato and mushroom <br>risotto between bowls. <br>• Sprinkle over flaked almonds and Parmesan <br>cheese (see ingredients) to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6819a751939c9c30689250b9/step-e74cf150.jpg"
    }
  ]
